 AskForNumberWithBigFonts;parms;question;InputFont;StdFont;LabelFont
 parms←##.GUI.Request.CreateParmsForNumber
 parms.value←10
 StdFont←⎕NEW'Font'(('PName' 'Georgia')('Size' 24))
 InputFont←⎕NEW'Font'(('PName' 'Courier New')('Size' 30))
 LabelFont←⎕NEW'Font'(('PName' 'Tahoma')('Size' 24))
 parms.(fontStandard fontInput fontLabel)←StdFont InputFont LabelFont
 question←''
 question,←⊂'Make sure you understand the request!'
 question,←⊂'This is a very very very very long line that defines the width of the form'
 question,←⊂'Number of copies:'
 question,←⊂''
 question,←⍕¨⍳10
 ⎕←parms ##.GUI.Request.AskForNumber question
⍝Done
